* Handle ad\\-hoc projects as assignedassigned.


**Job Requirements**
* University graduate or above;
* 1 year or above relevant experience in financial industry preferredpreferred (Fresh graduate is also welcome);
* Able to work under pressure and multi\\-tasking;
* Prudent and attentive to details;
* Proficiency in both written and spoken English and Chinese, fluency in Putonghua is a must;
* Good PC knowledge including MS Word, Excel and Chinese word processing.


**Benefits \\& Others**
 We offer an attractive remuneration package and fringe benefits to the right candidate. Interested applicants please send detailed resume stating present and expected salaries, as well as date of availability, by clicking "Apply" or by sending it to recruitment@gtjas.com.hk.




